    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the date is stated "Upon the lodgment"; the text names no date for a copy that has not been lodged

-- (5): the Court's power is "upon application by any person aggrieved and after notice to any other person whom the Court directs": "upon" and "after" are gates of "when" (split site (ii)).
