    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The Court may, by order upon application by any person aggrieved and after notice to any other person whom the Court directs, confirm, vary or rescind the certificate" (a failed "upon" or "after": the periods ruling of 2026-11-05, item (b); split site (ii), fork line F-H-S1)

-- src:3458 | (5) The Court may, by order upon application by any person
-- src:3459 | aggrieved and after notice to any other person whom the Court
