GIVETH A DATE
`s 15(4) the last day of the period mentioned in subsection (3)(b)` MEANS
    `period: the last day of a period after` `the date of service of the notice under subsection (2)` 14 Days

-- src:3511 | (4) The period referred to in subsection (3)(b) is the period
-- src:3512 | beginning on the day on which the document was delivered to the
-- src:3513 | Registrar as mentioned in subsection (2) and ending on the 14th day
-- src:3514 | after the date of service of the notice under subsection (2) by virtue of
